sequenceDiagram
  participant O as operator
  participant CLI as migrate --retarget
  participant V as Vercel API
  participant S as 新 Blob store
  participant R as registry.json
  participant B as Bridge
  O->>CLI: --vercel-token-env / --project-name
  CLI->>CLI: 取 hosting-mutation 长锁
  CLI->>V: GET/POST 项目
  CLI->>CLI: journal 写 intent
  CLI->>V: POST store(access=private)
  CLI->>V: GET store 校验 private/available
  CLI->>V: POST connections
  CLI->>V: GET env 解密 RW token
  CLI->>CLI: secrets.env(0600)
  loop 保留期每份报告(journal 三元组不同才传)
    CLI->>S: put gzip r/token/index.html
  end
  CLI->>V: 部署双格式网关
  CLI->>S: 探针对象 put/get/del
  CLI->>R: commitRetarget CAS(source key + 两个 digest)
  alt stale(期间有新 publish)
    R-->>CLI: ReportRetargetManifestStale
    CLI->>S: 补传 → 重部署 → 重验(最多 3 pass)
  else 成功
    R-->>CLI: cutoverAt
  end
  CLI-->>O: JSON + envHint + secrets 路径
  O->>O: 改 .env 两行,rm secrets
  B->>B: 下次 publish 读到新 token
  B->>R: token store id == hosting.storeId
  B->>S: gzip put
